Assertions:
[DOM] on every page the body font-family list starts with Inter {SPEC}
[DOM] on every page the h1 font-family list starts with Geologica {SPEC}
[REL] the dark-mode fonts equal the light-mode fonts on the same page {SPEC}

[DOM] every widget title has computed text-transform none {SPEC}
[DOM] every widget title has computed font-weight 600 {SPEC}
[FORMAT] every title's rendered text is not all capitals (it differs from its own toUpperCase()) {SPEC}

[DOM] under print the header, the footer and the account rail have computed display none (or zero height) on both pages {SPEC}
[DOM] under print the order lines and totals stay visible {SPEC}
[REL] the order total printed == the order total on screen {SPEC}

[DOM] the badge text is "2" {SPEC}
[DOM] the Compare link's accessible name is "Compare: 2" and the badge itself is aria-hidden {SPEC}
[REL] the badge's left edge is at the icon's horizontal centre (±2 px) and the icon stays visible {SPEC}

[DOM] the cart badge reads "99+" {SPEC}
[DOM] the hover tooltip shows the exact count 150 {SPEC}
[DOM] the cart link's accessible name contains 150, not "99+" {SPEC}

Steps:
